# Only what the image runs is listed, so a local checkout's git history, tests,
# caches and untracked files other than top-level modules stay out of the image.
# A new top-level module is picked up; a new package needs a line.
*
!*.py
!providers/*.py
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!LICENSE
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
